            "source:c5b9c0273c22550238727d3d",
            "source:b8be1474604e22033efe362e"
          ],
          "text": "Theka the Martyr is a long-dead troll associated with an ancient tablet in Zul'Farrak. A tale says his persecutors were cursed into scarabs; he fights with a fevered plague and can transform as he weakens.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 7272
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
