            "source:cf9cd1f3d17613dba7a8dd61"
          ],
          "text": "Hydromancer Velratha is a Zul'Farrak figure whom Tabetha accuses of sending agents to steal her Tiara of the Deep. Yeh'kinya identifies Velratha as holding the second Mosh'aru tablet near Gahz'rilla. In combat, Velratha casts Frostbolt and uses Healing Wave on a wounded friendly.",
