          "text": "Antu'sul, Overseer of Sul, commands the Sul'lithuz as his children and masterfully turns them against intruders, calling attackers lunch and ordering the creatures to rise and defend him. His words describe the minions protecting their master; in combat he also uses Earthgrab Totem and Healing Ward.",
